     <P style="WIDOWS: 2; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 'Microsoft YaHei'; WHITE-SPACE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: medium; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; WORD-SPACING: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial"><STRONG><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">编者按：</SPAN></STRONG></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; WIDOWS: 2; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 32px; FONT-FAMILY: 'Microsoft YaHei'; WHITE-SPACE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: medium; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; WORD-SPACING: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">鲁家贤先生是绍兴一中</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">1956</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">届校友，著名乡贤、爱乡楷模。从</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">1987</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">年起，鲁先生就在母校设立了</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">鲁家贤奖学金</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">，用于每年奖励品学兼优的学生。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">2019</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">年，鲁先生及其子高央先生又出资</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">3000</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">万元（分</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">5</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">年实施）设立</SPAN><STRONG><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">“</SPAN></SPAN></STRONG><STRONG><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">绍兴一中英贤计划</SPAN></STRONG><STRONG><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">”</SPAN></SPAN></STRONG><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">项目，用于支持母校引进高层次人才、奖励教学业绩优秀的教师团队和高考、竞赛成绩优异的学生，助力母校更好、更优、更有特色发展。其中，</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">英贤学生奖</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">专门奖励每年在高考与竞赛中成绩优异的学生。</SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; WIDOWS: 2; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 32px; FONT-FAMILY: 'Microsoft YaHei'; WHITE-SPACE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: medium; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; WORD-SPACING: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">2019</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">年度</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">英贤学生奖</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">已经颁发。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">2019</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">届一大批考取一流大学的高三毕业生获此殊荣。拿到沉甸甸的奖金（</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">名校录取</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">分</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">2000</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">元</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">/</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">人、</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">4000</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">元</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">/</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">人两档，</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">竞赛获奖</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">分</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">10000</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">元</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">/</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">人、</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">20000</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">元</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">/</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">人两档），已经在各大著名高校深造的一中学子们纷纷<STRONG>表达了对母校老师、对鲁家贤学长的诚挚感谢和美好祝愿</STRONG>。<STRONG>他们在感言中，诉说一中情怀，分享大学体验，描绘青春梦想，对一中的学弟学妹们很有启发意义。</STRONG></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; WIDOWS: 2; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 32px; FONT-FAMILY: 'Microsoft YaHei'; WHITE-SPACE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: medium; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; WORD-SPACING: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">我们分批为大家奉上这些获奖者的感言，<STRONG>既彰英贤，又启来者</STRONG>。</SPAN></P><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202005/2020050509561939.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届高三</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>16</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">班</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">王亮捷</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">上海交通大学</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">很高兴也很荣幸能够获得英贤奖学金，感谢鲁家贤先生的慷慨捐助，也更要感谢绍兴一中的老师们对我的悉心培养，这样才让我有了这样一个宝贵的机会。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在绍兴一中的三年是我汲取知识的三年，也是我从稚气未脱慢慢走向成熟的三年。这三年并不是顺风顺水的三年，从高一第一学期就能参加物理竞赛的喜悦到第一次选考失利的担忧，再到尘埃落定后的平静，这三年无疑是跌宕起伏的。在这沉浮飘摇的三年里，心路的艰辛远远要多于课业难度的压力，也正是因为这样的艰辛，我才更感谢一中不咄咄逼人的氛围，感谢陈老师对我一如既往的信任和开导。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在绍兴一中获得的也不只有成绩和知识，我也收获了志同道合的朋友，更收获了人生的哲理。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">绍兴一中是一座百年名校，我很骄傲，她是我的母校。她的历史底蕴，她的人文传承，值得每一位学生为成为其中一员而心向往之。最后，希望仍在绍兴一中的勤学奋斗的学弟学妹们能够突破自我，让自己的高中生涯有一个完美的结局。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202005/2020050509563045.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届高三</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">班</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">刘依兰</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">浙江大学</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">非常感谢学校授予“英贤奖”的荣誉，感谢鲁家贤先生对学校的关心支持。高中三年来在数位恩师的教导下，我取得了长足的进步，认识到了求知与进取的快乐。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">英贤奖是学校给予我的认可，更是一份激励，一种鞭策，是母校的辉煌在我身上燃起的希望光芒。肩负希望却尚且稚嫩的我们将为之努力前行，唯有这样才能够问心无愧，不负师恩。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202005/2020050509564158.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届高三</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>15</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">班</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">张刘灯</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">浙江大学</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">说起来，这是第三次从家人以外的地方搞到收入了。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">第一次是在大约高三，写了两篇漫评投了一个没什么人关注的公众号，加起来挣了三十元左右。（我也是从那时候才知道，对于微信公众号，大约一千次点击量就等于一块钱。而微信号下方的小广告被某人戳一下也差不多是这个数）如果把经营公众号的小哥送的两块立牌一对</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2233</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">娘御守换算成金额，这个收入可以乘以三。这或许依然微不足道——但第一次看着自己码下的字可以转换成微信红包，看着自己半夜在被窝里找的配图被做成了推文封面，这种愉悦感是前所未有的。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">第二次倒是很常规的毕业暑假工，当了两个小朋友的家教，教自己意外考得不错的数学，赚了恰好等同于自己一年学费的工薪。虽然这笔收入是上一次的一百多倍，但金额大了后反而少了实感。只是在半夜零点还在备课的时候不禁感慨一声为人师表甚是不易。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">至于第三次就是这回。说到这里，想必你也已经发现：我在一中是没有什么值得洋洋得意的特长的。也正是因此，在一中三年半，我其实很少有光鲜亮丽走上领奖台的时刻。我就一直像是影子里的人，虽然人缘似乎还不错，知名度也不低（单纯因为皮），但是从初中带来的自卑感却一直挥之不去，像是梦魇时看见的紫红色藤蔓，从各个角落延伸出来，把我裹在其中。我始终是个小孩，普通的小孩，缩在漆黑一片的小河旁边数星星，羡慕它们能穿透数万光年到达地表的炽热与闪耀。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">不过正是因此，我发现了一中许多角角落落里潜藏的宝藏。这些宝藏完全是公共资源，但少有人来开发。比如图书馆。二楼的自习室，广阔得像个小教堂，却几乎坐不满一桌人；三楼的两个报告厅，意外地适合午睡用……我依然记得四月选考之后，我与落寞感在这里的朝朝夕夕。我依然记得落地窗外的暖暖朝阳，记得在这里偷摸摸发现的聂鲁达的诗集，记得躲着老师在长沙发上睡觉，记得每天提早两三分钟去食堂抢砂锅饭，记得吃饭路上那扇推开必吱呀一声响的侧门，记得在半路上撞见截杀我们的班主任，记得我们绕过班主任从另一个门去食堂……</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">我多么希望那个图书馆里的人能全来浙大。浙大很好，几乎满足了我对一流大学所有的幻想，但是这里太大了，这里太冷了。我在这里，是残缺的。而缺掉的那几块，则早就随着一张张录取通知书散播去了珠海武汉南京上海，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>etc.<o:p></o:p></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">或许就是因为这一点，我才一直心心念念要来“饮水思源”，要来招呼学弟学妹们多来浙大。我本质上依然是一个天真的小孩，整天天马行空胡思乱想，但是即使这样子，我还是要说：我希望能来浙大的学弟学妹尽量来浙大，希望来了浙大的同学尽量多和我们联系，希望我们能在浙大建立一个“小一中”。即使我的理智告诉我，这不过是乌托邦，不过是幼稚者的幻想，不过是一个社交失败者的梦呓。“此心安处是吾乡”的文青梦，在现实面前，似乎总是那么柔弱无力。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">回忆带刺，一如蔷薇，伤痕斑驳后，才知最美时光业已凋谢。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR" lang=EN-US><o:p> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202005/2020050509565562.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR" lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">届高三<SPAN lang=EN-US>16</SPAN>班<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>严至简<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>浙江大学<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">能获得这次“英贤学生奖”，于我而言，是莫大的荣誉，更是我前进的动力。我要感谢绍兴一中为我提供的学习环境，感谢指导我激励我学习的同学老师，感谢心系母校大力支持母校发展的鲁家贤先生。三年半的一中生涯告诉我，努力学习，定能有所收获。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">高中的时候，我会觉得，把书上的知识学通，考试能拿高分，这就够了。固然，书本上的知识确实能为你打下良好的基础，但是书本和课程的更新速度远远慢于知识更新迭代的速度。这也就意味着你学习的永远是过时的知识。有人会问，难道不学课本吗？不是的。第一，书本上一些最基本的东西，是新知识的根基，不会被很快迭代；第二，也是最要的一点，我们不是为了考试而学，是为了学习如何学习而学。学习作为一个活动，在拓宽我们的知识、提高我们的理论能力的同时，也在培养着我们的学习能力。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">到了大学我更清楚地发现，大学不再追求面对试题你能拿多少分，大学中所追求的是你在面对一个新事物新领域时候的学习能力。老师的讲课速度远远超过高中，一个学期可以换好几门课……这对于我们预习和自学的能力就有相当高的要求；探究性实验，开放式演讲，科研训练项目等等学习活动，考验的是“目的驱动性”的学习能力，你在短时间内学习的所有内容都只有一个目的——解决问题。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-language: AR">一中的培养方式，让我能在进入大学之后快速适应新的学习模式。我相信，在一中积累的学习经验，定能让你受益终生！<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202005/2020050509571107.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届高三</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>16</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">班</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">钱书仰</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri> <SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN></FONT></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">浙江大学</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">很荣幸能够获得母校的英贤奖学金，感谢得到母校和鲁家贤先生的肯定。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在绍兴一中的三年无疑是难忘的三年，我会永远记得在这里遇到的一位位辛勤付出的老师，一个个一起笑过哭过的同学。高中三年，真的让我成长了很多。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">最后，祝福高三的学弟学妹们在即将到来的高考中取得满意的成绩，美好而艰辛的大学生活在等待着你们。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
